  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Removal Centres&apos; Capacities and Fostering Alternatives to Administrative Detention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the Directorate General of Migration Management of Turkey to better manage irregular migration and reinforce the procedural safeguards at the reception centres in line with international and EU standards and best practices. The project further aims to strengthen national capacities and knowledge on immigration detention practices and standards and on promoting alternatives to detention (ATDs), while supporting developments of national policies and practices, especially on ATDs. It is essential that ATDs are available in law and implemented in practice; that conditions of immigration detention, where detention is necessary and unavoidable, meet international and EU standards.</narrative>
  </description>
